%% ----------------------------------------------- Unified multi-task families
%% NOTE ON SCOPE, checked against the published abstracts:
%%  - UnifyImmun (yu2025unifyimmun) predicts the TWO pairwise tasks
%%    (peptide--HLA and peptide--TCR) with two cross-attention branches over a
%%    shared peptide encoder and a two-phase progressive training strategy. It
%%    does NOT have a three-way peptide--HLA--TCR head. Do not write that it
%%    does.
%%  - UniPMT (zhao2025unipmt) DOES perform P--M--T, P--M and P--T jointly, but
%%    as a heterogeneous graph neural network over peptide/MHC/TCR nodes with
